  "result": {
    "summary": "Implemented and audited exact physical-v6 ELO K-best from-zero training, completed 34,238 physical hands plus 26,624 evaluation hands, and found decisive self-play learning but significantly worse untouched-opponent transfer.",
    "conclusion": "The mechanism works but the unmodified local paper-LR regimen does not generalize at smoke scale. Final dominated its initial actor by +6798.45 bb/100 with CI lower +6729.34, yet paired transfer versus untouched Standard10 worsened by -161.21 bb/100 with CI95 [-283.35,-39.07]. Max first-update KL1.074 and near-zero fold frequency identify aggressive policy movement and costly tail losses as the leading optimization risk.",
    "decision": "REJECT_UNMODIFIED_FRESH_ZERO_PAPER_LR_SCALE",
    "next_step": "Run one matched fresh-zero exact-v6 ELO trust-region smoke from the identical deterministic initialization/deal/tournament seeds, changing only PPO target-KL early stop to .01. Require reduced KL/clip exposure, retained positive final-vs-init LCB, and nonnegative paired Standard10 transfer before any 262k continuation."
